atus":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m066-0255","start":255,"end":257,"surface":"屈丐","kind":"person","person_id":"c38_dzq_0o4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m066-0287","start":287,"end":290,"surface":"庶長疾","kind":"person","person_id":"r9n_0vc_ywa","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m066-0297","start":297,"end":299,"surface":"到滿","kind":"person","person_id":"rwt_f3r_d8n","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m066-0320","start":320,"end":323,"surface":"蜀相壯","kind":"person","person_id":"kqe_x0t_s25","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m066-0324","start":324,"end":326,"surface":"蜀侯","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"官稱、氏族、群體或未核指代；不補造個人或按熟知世系自動合併。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-005-qin","book_id":"b-shiji-005","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-005-qin"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:p068","text":"武王元年，與魏惠王會臨晉。誅蜀相壯。張儀、魏章皆東出之魏。伐義渠、丹、犁。二年，初置丞相，摢裏疾、甘茂為左右丞相。張儀死於魏。三年，與韓襄王會臨晉外。南公揭卒，摢裏疾相韓。武王謂甘茂曰：「寡人欲容車通三川，窺周室，死不恨矣。」其秋，使甘茂、庶長封伐宜陽。四年，拔宜陽，斬首六萬。涉河，城武遂。魏太子來朝。武王有力好戲，力士任鄙、烏獲、孟說皆至大官。王與孟說舉鼎，絕臏。八月，武王死。族孟說。武王取魏女為后，無子。立異母弟，是為昭襄王。昭襄母楚人，姓羋氏，號宣太后。武王死時，昭襄王為質於燕，燕人送歸，得立。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m068-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"武王","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAAAAAAAAAABAAAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m068-0006","start":6,"end":9,"surface":"魏惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"bhp_5xd_88r","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m068-0014","start":14,"end":17,"surface":"蜀相壯","kind":"person","person_id":"kqe_x0t_s25","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m068-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"張儀","kind":"person","person_id":"uq6_74z_vtv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m068-0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"魏章","kind":"person","person_id":"2pv_dtb_lrw","status":"contextual_provisio